      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just a feeling though. it's the reality. he’s exhausted, he’s always stressed about the bills, and i can’t even help him with the dishes anymore without needing to sit down. i look at him and i just see how much better his life would be if he didn't have to worry about me constantly. if he didn't have this whole extra weight to carry.",
